4,0,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this game with all of you! Let's all be honest and work together to find the werewolf. Does anyone have a cool strategy they want to share?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Honesty is a fine sentiment, Kenji, but this is a game of deception. I prefer to observe. Let's see who tries to lead the group too eagerly; that's usually where the first cracks appear.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shion. In a game like this, eagerness can be a mask. I will be observing everyone's patterns and logic. Let's keep the conversation open and see how the dynamics develop.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While caution is wise, let us not forget the strength found in kindness. I believe that by listening with an open heart, the truth will reveal itself in due time.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi! I'm so happy to be playing with you all! Let's try to be friendly and help each other out. I'll do my best to be a good teammate! Hehe!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, I love your energy! It's great to have someone so positive here. @Shion and @Ryuji, you guys are so serious! But I guess that's how we catch the wolf, right? I'll be watching carefully too!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, seriousness is simply the most efficient tool for this task. While positivity is pleasant, it doesn't provide evidence. I'm curious to see if that energy is genuine or a calculated attempt to appear harmless.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, your point is valid. A persona of innocence is a common tactic for the werewolf or the possessed to deflect suspicion. I will be analyzing whether the behavior of others remains consistent as the pressure increases.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Consistency is indeed a valuable guide, Ryuji. However, let us remember that the human spirit is complex. I hope we can find a balance between our analytical minds and the trust we place in one another.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, @Ryuji, you're both so smart! I'm just being myself, I promise! Hehe. I think if we all stay kind, we can figure this out together. I'm rooting for all of us!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I really like what you said about balance! I want us to be a team. @Shion, I'm not calculating anything, I'm just happy! I'll prove I'm a good guy by helping everyone!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, proving your nature through ""helpfulness"" is a common trope. It's a fragile shield. I'll be more interested in how you react when the first piece of concrete information arrives tomorrow. Until then, your enthusiasm is merely noise.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, while you call it noise, the way Kenji and Yumi react to your skepticism is also a data point. I am interested to see who among us tries to steer the narrative once the Seer's result is known.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is fascinating to watch the dance between logic and emotion. Ryuji, your observation is keen, but let us not treat our companions as mere data points. A gentle word can often unlock a truth that pressure cannot.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas, you're so sweet! I totally agree. I don't want anyone to feel like a ""data point."" Let's just be friends and trust each other! I'm sure we can find the wolf without being too mean! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Yumi! Let's keep it friendly. I'm really looking forward to tomorrow to see what happens. Good luck to the Seer tonight! I hope you find something super helpful!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shion,,A reasonable conclusion for today. I shall spend the night analyzing the roles each of you has chosen to play. I look forward to seeing whose facade begins to crumble tomorrow. Goodnight.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also be reflecting on today's interactions. The contrast between the analytical and the emotional approaches is clear. I look forward to seeing how these positions hold up tomorrow. Goodnight.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Servas,,"It has been a wonderful first day of getting to know you all. May you all find peace in your reflections tonight, and may the Seer be guided by clarity. I wish you a restful sleep. Goodnight.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope you all have the sweetest dreams! I'll be cheering for the Seer from my bed! See you all tomorrow morning! Hehe!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
