35,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well! I have some really big news... I'm the Seer! I checked on Shion last night, and it turns out Shion is the werewolf! We found the wolf already!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role and pointing at me in the very first turn is a bold move. However, it's far too convenient. A real Seer would be more cautious about their safety. This is a clumsy attempt to frame me.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role immediately is a high-risk strategy. While it provides a clear target, it also makes you the primary target for the werewolf tonight. I find the timing and directness highly suspicious.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your eagerness to help us is admirable, but such a sudden revelation is like a storm that arrives without warning. Let us all breathe and consider this claim with a calm and steady heart.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, wow! You're the Seer?! That's so amazing! But @Shion looks really surprised... I don't want us to make a mistake and hurt a friend! Are you sure, Kenji? Hehe!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, I'm super sure! The Seer's power doesn't lie! @Shion, @Ryuji, I know it seems fast, but why wait and let the wolf eat more of us? I want to save everyone right now! Please believe me!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your ""desire to save everyone"" is a convenient emotional shield. By claiming the Seer role so aggressively, you've forced the group into a binary choice. It's a classic tactic to eliminate a threat—or a rival—quickly. Who else benefits from my execution?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, you raise a valid point. By creating a binary choice, Kenji is attempting to bypass a more thorough analysis. @Kenji, if you are the Seer, your logic is based on speed, but your method lacks the caution typically associated with the role.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your heart is full of passion, but remember that haste can sometimes cloud the truth. @Shion, @Ryuji, let us not let suspicion turn into hostility. Perhaps we can find a middle ground of understanding.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, you're so brave for speaking up so quickly! But @Shion and @Ryuji are making some really scary points. I'm getting a little confused... I really hope we can all just be honest! What do you think, @Servas? Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion"",""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I just want us to be safe! @Shion, you're just saying those things because you're the wolf! @Ryuji, I'm not trying to bypass anything, I'm just telling you the truth! Please, let's just vote for Shion!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your desperation is becoming palpable. You've abandoned logic for emotional appeals, which only confirms your instability. If you are the wolf, you've just painted a target on your own back for tonight. @Ryuji, surely you see this as a clumsy frame.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, I do see the lack of finesse in Kenji's approach. However, we must consider the possibility that the werewolf is simply playing a high-risk, high-reward game. @Kenji, your insistence is not evidence. I am still weighing the probability of a frame versus a reckless Seer.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, your weighing of probabilities is a wise practice. However, let us also consider the possibility that Kenji's recklessness is born of a pure desire to protect us. Truth often wears an unexpected face.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, @Shion, please don't be so mean to Kenji! He's just trying to help us! But it's so scary when everyone is arguing... I really want to believe Kenji, but I'm still a little worried. What should we do? Hehe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, thank you for being on my side! @Ryuji, @Servas, please trust me! I'm just a kid, I don't know how to be ""finesse,"" I just know what I saw! Let's vote for Shion and win this!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, using your age as a shield is the final refuge of a failing lie. @Ryuji, @Servas, voting for me based on the word of someone this unstable is a gamble we cannot afford. I suggest we execute the fake Seer.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, @Kenji, both of your arguments have flaws. Kenji's lack of caution is suspicious, but Shion's immediate counter-attack is equally expected of a werewolf. However, executing a potential Seer is a greater risk than executing a potential wolf. I will vote based on logic.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Servas,,"My dear friends, we have reached a crossroads where logic and emotion are in conflict. While Kenji's approach is impulsive, his spirit is bright. Let us cast our votes with a peaceful mind, trusting that the truth will guide us.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"This is so hard! I don't want to pick the wrong person and make everyone sad! But Kenji seems so sure, and he's been so honest with us. I'll trust my heart and Kenji! I'm voting for Shion! Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
